    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The armpits are where wisdom lies! That's where true desire lies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You read that right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains 75 illustrations of women's beautiful armpits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital art book allows you to play simple games and enjoy a collection of illustrations of women's armpits, which represent the crystallization of wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe illustrations and music used in this game were created by generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWe recommend using a controller when playing this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe controller display for this game is based on the Xbox controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Do you want to see behind the mosaic?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mosaic is a complicated mosaic applied to the naughty illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to hit the button and hit the button and hit the button, with only your enthusiasm and desire to see the other side of the mosaic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game is a simple game where all you have to do is to hit the button repeatedly to erase the mosaic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's get rid of the mosaic now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Soundtrack Created by Suno, the AI Music Generator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of tracks created using Suno, a state-of-the-art AI music generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be amazed by the cutting-edge technology and the exceptional quality of these compositions!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The armpits are where wisdom lies! That's where true desire lies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You read that right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains 75 illustrations of women's beautiful armpits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital art book allows you to play simple games and enjoy a collection of illustrations of women's armpits, which represent the crystallization of wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe illustrations and music used in this game were created by generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWe recommend using a controller when playing this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe controller display for this game is based on the Xbox controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Do you want to see behind the mosaic?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mosaic is a complicated mosaic applied to the naughty illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to hit the button and hit the button and hit the button, with only your enthusiasm and desire to see the other side of the mosaic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game is a simple game where all you have to do is to hit the button repeatedly to erase the mosaic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's get rid of the mosaic now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Soundtrack Created by Suno, the AI Music Generator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of tracks created using Suno, a state-of-the-art AI music generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be amazed by the cutting-edge technology and the exceptional quality of these compositions!</p>",
